                <mxCell id="46" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;DF_UPDATED&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;The updated df should contain an extra column informing whether or not a trade decision has been made&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
